# Docker build context excludes (ADR-0044). The pos_cloud image builds from the repo
# root, so keep the context to the source cargo actually needs — the two huge trees are
# .git and target, and secrets must never enter an image layer. Every crate's Cargo.toml
# and src/ stays in, because cargo reads the whole workspace to build one member.
.git/
target/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
deploy/secrets/
vendor/
**/*.rs.bk
